        ex:hasText "The solution must not undermine Cabinet Vauclair & Associés anti-money-laundering obligations (LCB-FT)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk66> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The titleholder must comply with the legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents.  5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk67> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Technical constraints  5.1 Performance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk68> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Response times compatible with daily professional use are expected — as an indication, below 2 seconds for common queries — and The solution must sustain The solution performance during seasonal peak loads (closing periods, tax campaigns).  5.2 Availability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk69> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A high level of availability during business hours is required, with resilience to seasonal peak loads.  5.3 Integration and interoperability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk7> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The chartered accountant or statutory auditor remains the sole validator: no deliverable is produced or signed without professional validation.  3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk70> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must integrate with Cabinet Vauclair & Associés production tools (accounting-production software, payroll software, document management / GED) and with the electronic-invoicing / dematerialisation environment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk71> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "API-type interfaces are expected, as is integration with the user directory (SSO).  6." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Sovereignty constraints  Given the confidential financial nature of the data, hosting on SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure or equivalent is preferred, and particular attention will be paid to dependency on non-European suppliers.  7." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk73> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Budget constraints  The budget allocated to the project is, as an indication, €220,000 over 3 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk74> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The annual operating cost must remain controlled." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk75> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As Cabinet Vauclair & Associés is an SME, the titleholder must propose an approach that optimises costs while guaranteeing the expected quality of service.  8." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk76> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Environmental constraints  Cabinet Vauclair & Associés wishes to limit the environmental footprint of the solution and to rely, as far as possible, on low-carbon infrastructure.  9." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk77> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Deployment terms  the project must be conducted progressively, with a pilot phase on one office or one mission line, followed by progressive generalisation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk78> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Change-management support and training are expected." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk79> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Ideally, a pilot should be operational before the next closing / tax campaign.  10." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk8> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Functional scope  3.1 Information consultation assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk80> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Evaluation criteria  Offers will be evaluated against: quality and relevance of the solution; reliability and traceability of outputs; confidentiality and security; respect of professional secrecy and of auditor independence; data sovereignty; quality of integration with Cabinet Vauclair & Associés production tools; total cost; quality of support; environmental considerations; capacity for innovation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk81> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the client's requirements for a non-decisional artificial intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity, preserves professional secrecy and reliability of figures, what steps can we take to ensure we proposed solution aligns with Cabinet Vauclair & Associés' existing practices and does not introduce any rupture in Cabinet Vauclair & Associés' working methods?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk82> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure our proposed solution aligns with Cabinet Vauclair & Associés' existing practices and does not introduce any rupture in their working methods, we can take the following steps." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, during the framing phase of we hybrid delivery model, we will pay particular attention to confidentiality, Cabinet Vauclair & Associés' existing production tools, and the seasonality of the workload, as is customary for professional-services clients." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This will help we understand professional-services clients current practices and identify potential areas where our proposed solution can integrate seamlessly." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Secondly, we flagship product, Atelier, is designed to forge document-grounded AI assistants from an organisation's own documents, which means our flagship product, Atelier can be tailored to work with Cabinet Vauclair & Associés' existing documentation and methodologies. tailored ensures that our flagship product, Atelier is grounded in professional-services clients specific context and will not disrupt professional-services clients established workflows." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Thirdly, we will work closely with the client through we joint steering committee and operational committee to ensure that our proposed solution meets the client needs and expectations. we point of contact, the project director, will be responsible for ensuring that the client requirements are understood and addressed throughout the project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, by conducting a pilot phase before generalising our proposed solution, as outlined in we project management methodology, we can test and refine we approach to ensure our proposed solution fits smoothly into Cabinet Vauclair & Associés' existing practices without causing any disruption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This progressive deployment will allow we to address any concerns or issues that arise and make necessary adjustments before scaling up our proposed solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By following the following steps, we can ensure that our proposed solution aligns with Cabinet Vauclair & Associés' existing practices and does not introduce any rupture in their working methods, while also meeting Cabinet Vauclair & Associés' requirements for a non-decisional artificial intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity and preserves professional secrecy and reliability of figures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Quick access to reliable, up-to-date information drawn from accounting standards (PCG), tax doctrine and the tax code (CGI), the commercial code and applicable legal texts, collective-bargaining agreements for payroll/social, and Cabinet Vauclair & Associés internal procedures and methodology guides." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires response times below 2 seconds for common queries, a high level of availability during business hours (with resilience to seasonal peak loads), API integration with the firm's production tools, hosting on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by the tender within the EU, and no dependency on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For each requirement state whether each requirement is FULLY COVERED, PARTIALLY COVERED or NOT COVERED by the firm's current stack, and describe the proposed architecture." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requirements can be addressed as follows: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Response times below 2 seconds for common queries: The median latency of the firm's platform is 1.3 seconds, and the p95 latency is below 2.5 seconds, which suggests that this requirement is FULLY COVERED. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "High level of availability during business hours with resilience to seasonal peak loads: our platform is designed to scale horizontally and can be sized for seasonal peak loads, ensuring high availability during business hours." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This requirement is FULLY COVERED. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "API integration with the firm's production tools: the firm's have an API-first design with documented APIs that can be embedded in existing work environments, which includes connectors and adapters for accounting-production and payroll software, document-management systems, and electronic-invoicing/dematerialisation environments." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This requirement is FULLY COVERED. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hosting on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by the tender within the EU: the firm's offer a hosting option on OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, EU-only, and renewable-powered. a hosting option on OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, EU-only, and renewable-powered is FULLY COVERED. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No dependency on non-European suppliers: the firm's Sovereign European open-weight model is hosted by Faber IA on OuraneCloud, ensuring no dependency on non-European suppliers for Our Sovereign European open-weight model." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

